    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "BE55",
        "Packaging and storage"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "BE55 should be stored in dry conditions at temperatures below 50°C and protected from UV-light. Improper storage can initiate degradation, which can\nresult in odour generation and colour changes and can have negative effects on the physical properties of this product."
    },
