    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "BE55",
        "BE55",
        "Sustainability aspects"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Borealis is ever mindful of the impact of our products on the planet. We promote Design for Circularity (DfC) and Design for Recycling (DfR) to conserve\nnatural resources and to reduce the environmental impact of products over their entire lifetime (including production, use phase and after phase). DfR\nhelps ensure that material can be effectively recycled while maximizing the material performance efficiency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "BE55",
        "BE55",
        "Sustainability aspects"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Further information on sustainability and Design for Recycling (DfR) can be found from our websites www.borealisgroup.com and\nwww.borealiseverminds.com."
    },
